REDNET - talk to other computers
Usage: rednet <status|open|close|send|inbox|clear> [args]

Sends messages between nearby computers over the rednet peripheral.

status   (default) show the rednet state, message counts and computer id
open [n]    open channel n (default 1)
close [n]   close channel n
send <message> [n]  send a message on channel n
inbox    list messages received during this session
clear    empty the inbox

Examples:
  rednet open
  rednet send hello
  rednet inbox
